"CRSF/ELRS also requires a TX1 connection, in addition to RX1, and "
"automatically provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF/ELRS 除 RX1 外还需要连接 TX1，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-corvonf405v2_1.rst:49
