"FPort requires connection to TX1 and :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>`"
" set to \"7\". See :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr ""
"FPort 需要连接到 TX1，并将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设为 \"7\"。参见 "
":ref:`common-FPort-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-corvonf405v2_1.rst:50
