#: f9760056facb484c8aba9273da327cec
msgid ""
"The CORVON405V2.1 supports analog OSD via its internal MAX7456. Simultaneous"
" external HD OSD support is preconfigured on SERIAL6. See :ref:`common-msp-"
"osd-overview-4.2` for more info."
msgstr ""
"CORVON405V2.1 通过其内部 MAX7456 支持模拟 OSD。同时在 SERIAL6 上预配置了外接 HD OSD 支持。更多信息参见 "
":ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-corvonf405v2_1.rst:57
