"Both Analog and HD VTX connectors are provided. Pin 1 of the connector is 9v"
" so be careful not to connect this to a peripheral unable to support that "
"voltage."
msgstr "板上同时提供模拟和 HD VTX 接口。接口的 1 号引脚为 9V，注意不要将其接到无法承受该电压的外设上。"

