msgid ""
"The CORVON405V2.1 does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL connector."
msgstr "CORVON405V2.1 没有内置罗盘，但可以通过 SDA 和 SCL 接口用 I2C 外接罗盘。"

